WEBVTT

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.040
So hot...

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.200
This is such a pain.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.330
Aw, c'mon! Let's make some memories together!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.870
Ooh, look! A triangle!

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:31.790
Sweet! Let's take a pic.

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:33.910
All right, we're off.

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:37.750
Will the dorm be okay without me?

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:40.160
Yes, don't you worry!

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:42.500
You being gone won't change anything.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.000
I'm going with.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.040
What?

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:47.620
Nope. It's for Summer Troupe's rehearsal.

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:49.250
Then I'll join Summer Troupe.

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:52.200
Masumi, what about Spring Troupe?!

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.870
How come <i>you </i>get to go anyway?

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:56.500
Me?

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:58.790
I'm going to run errands, of course!

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:01.120
He's way too eager about being their errand boy!

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:02.870
I'll do that, too.

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:06.950
C'mon, stop acting like a kid.

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:08.040
Lemme go, Tsuzuru!

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:11.250
I'll hold this one down. You guys go ahead.

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:14.620
Do you best, everyone!

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:18.370
And Tenma... I hope everything goes well.

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:20.790
Yeah.

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:57.370
"Summer Camp"

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:04.750
Okay, we're here!

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.580
We made it, guys.

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:12.660
We're staying here?

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:14.370
So stereotypical.

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:17.500
Really reminds me of a club training camp.

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:19.700
Triangular roof!

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:23.750
Nice, so retro! Gotta post this on Instablam.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:25.700
C'mon, you two, let's snap a pic together, too!

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:27.870
No photos.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:30.790
Stop messing around. Hurry up and get inside.

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:33.000
Okie dokie!

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:38.000
What's got him so motivated?

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.950
Let's go, Yuki.

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:53.500
Tell me, Scheherazade!
Where is the legendary paradise Oasis?!

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:57.870
Then, I will spin another tale for you tonight.
Long ago, in a faraway land--

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:00.040
Just cut to the chase!
Give it to me in four words or less!

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:03.000
Aladdin. Magic lamp. Magician.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.410
Great, be right back!

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:08.200
Be careful out there, Ali Baba!

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:09.250
Yuki, for that line--

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.870
Hey.

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:13.410
Scheherazade there shouldn't sound so carefree.

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:15.080
What?

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:20.700
Oh, because she's been ordered
to join the king's harem?

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:26.750
Yeah. That's made clear at the end,
but you need to act with that in mind.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.370
Yeah, okay.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:33.120
Be careful out there, Ali Baba!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:38.450
You've never been one to listen to others.
It's your biggest flaw.

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:41.750
Put more of her feelings
toward Ali Baba into that line.

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:44.160
Don't just go by instinct.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:46.790
Okay, <i>fine</i>.

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:49.410
Oh wow, she's really cute.

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:51.750
Hey! Wanna go out with me?

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.540
You need to be more enthusiastic there.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:55.700
Oh, really?

00:04:55.700 --> 00:05:00.040
She's your future wife. Alter your delivery
when you're flirting with her.

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:04.410
Ah, I see. Okay, gotcha.

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:08.250
Oh, grow up, Ali Baba.
There is no legendary parasite--

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:09.540
Paradise.

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:11.500
Sorry!

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:15.500
Oh, grow-- Oh, grow up, Ali Baba...

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.950
There is no legendary paradise...

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:21.080
There's no such thing as a legendary paradise.

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:24.290
The "legendary" part is right there in the name!

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:27.160
Face up to realit--Ooh!

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.580
What's wrong?

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:35.000
There's a triangle cloud!

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:37.910
We're in the middle of rehearsal!
Focus on acting!

00:05:37.910 --> 00:05:40.700
So many triangles!

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:43.250
Why don't we take a break?

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:50.160
So why did Scheherazade start telling the
<i>Thousand and One Nights </i>stories anyway?

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:51.660
Was it her job or something?

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.580
That's wrong.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:55.290
As a thank-you for giving her <i>omusubi</i>?

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.290
That's definitely wrong.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:06:01.580
Mm, we need Tsuzuroon here to tell us.

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:07.330
I might be wrong since this is
an adaptation of <i>Arabian Nights</i>,

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:13.080
but in the original, the king executed
the woman he spent each night with.

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:18.370
Scheherazade married the king
and told him the stories to put a stop to it.

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:21.370
Each night, she told him
a story until its climax,

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:24.700
then promised to tell
the rest the following day.

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:27.200
That's how she prevented him from executing her.

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:29.250
Mukkun, you know so much!

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:31.290
I read the whole series.

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:34.370
The whole thing?! Isn't it super long?

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.330
I borrowed it from the library.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:39.540
It had some more mature parts,

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:43.410
but I finished reading it in no time
since it was so interesting.

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:44.950
Muku.

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:50.700
Good job! I present to you Super Mr. Triangle!

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:52.410
What is this?

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:54.250
Super cute!

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:56.580
Uh, yeah. Cute.

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:58.000
Don't force yourself.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:01.160
He's "Super" because he's got a crown.

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:03.870
I've leveled up from the eraser.

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:05.160
Thank you.

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:07.790
Hey, did you read it to prep for your role?

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:12.870
Yes. I wanted to understand the world of
<i>The Thousand and One Nights</i>.

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:15.450
You put in the effort, I'll give you that.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.120
Thanks!

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:23.750
A king who kills women? I get why
she would never want to marry him.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:28.660
You understand Scheherazade's emotions now?
You should learn from Muku.

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:30.750
You annoy me.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:34.540
Tell me more details later, will you?
It'll help with the costumes, too.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:36.080
I'd be glad to!

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:41.950
Good job today!

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:44.250
Gimme some grub!

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:46.450
Onigiri! Onigiri!

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:48.660
What's the plan for dinner?

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:51.580
We'll all make it together
as a bonding exercise!

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:52.410
What?

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:54.450
You don't even have an onsite cook?

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:55.700
If you're okay with me--

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:57.000
No thanks.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:03.790
Not to worry. Tonight's dinner will be
authentic curry, loved by all humankind!

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:04.790
Again?!

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.620
Return of the Currian.

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:10.540
B-But, you know, her curry's delicious...

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:13.080
Yeah, it's delish.

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:15.410
I'm fine with anything if there's onigiri.

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:19.080
These spices were directly imported from India--

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:21.120
All right. I'm in charge of rice.

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:23.040
All you have to do is push a button.

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:25.290
Should I wash the vegetables?

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:26.870
I'll google the recipe.

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:29.580
I'm in charge of the onigiri.

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.580
Hey, make sure to wash the rice properly!

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:39.000
You're picky about everything, not just acting.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:41.540
I'm just saying what's common sense.

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:46.540
Wait, what type of rice is that?
I refuse to eat anything but Pikarin rice.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.200
You're too picky.

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:50.410
I'm just more refined than you!

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:53.830
Please calm down. This rice is good, too.

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:56.410
The hammy actor can shut up!

00:08:56.410 --> 00:09:00.290
Ham... is yummy with a side of radish.

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:03.120
Any rice is yummy if you make it into onigiri.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:05.580
That's only because you're a weirdo!

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:07.160
Aw.

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:10.910
What're you sighing about?

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:13.250
Your presence ruins the mood.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:16.910
It's <i>my </i>fault?! This all started
because you didn't wash the rice right!

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.790
Don't blame me.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:19.950
Say that again!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:26.080
C'mon, Tenten! You'll lose friends
if you don't play nice.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:33.500
Well unlike <i>you</i>, I'm not a people pleaser
who only has superficial friendships!

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:40.200
Uh...

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:49.200
There are things you just shouldn't say.

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:55.750
Tenma!

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:57.370
Just leave him be.

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:11.660
Oh, found you.

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:17.500
What do you want?

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:23.910
Here, it turned out really tasty! Miraculous.

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:25.950
Everybody's finished up already.

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:28.660
Don't want it.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:34.370
You haven't eaten anything, right?

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:37.450
You'll need the energy for rehearsals.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.160
It's good.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:51.410
Right? Everybody was raving about it!

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:55.370
Yuki even called me a Super Currian!

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:58.160
Why're you so happy about that nickname?

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:01.450
Hey, eat with the group tomorrow, will you?

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:06.750
They're all aware that you're looking after
them as their leader in your own way.

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:10.450
They're gaining a deeper understanding
of their roles thanks to you.

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:13.660
Don't you think their acting is improving?

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:15.660
They're still incompetent.

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:19.830
Rurikawa has the talent,
but he puts little thought into his lines.

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:22.500
His movements do have flair, though.

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:26.370
He knows how to present
himself to shine on stage.

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:28.160
Yeah.

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:32.200
Miyoshi goes with the flow,
which is both good and bad.

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:35.330
He's good at matching others,
but he's not aggressive enough.

00:11:35.330 --> 00:11:39.290
He has the flexibility
to adapt to anybody, though.

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:42.410
Sakisaka's acting is terrible,
but he's a hard worker.

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:45.790
He carefully analyzes his character.

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:50.330
If he can keep his nerves in check,
he has potential to improve greatly.

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:52.620
Ikaruga has some real skill.

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:56.870
His acting could rival mine
if he were serious about it.

00:11:56.870 --> 00:12:00.750
But his goofy side makes him hopeless.

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:04.120
What're you laughing for?

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:08.910
I'm just sure now that appointing you
as leader was the right decision.

00:12:11.450 --> 00:12:13.790
Apologize to them tomorrow.

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:16.870
Continue to point out their shortcomings,

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:20.620
but also note their achievements,
giving praise and criticism evenly.

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:25.040
You've had years more experience
as an actor. You can handle it, right?

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:27.910
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:34.040
I'll one day win a clean sweep of
the Best Actor award around the world.

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:36.580
Giving acting guidance will be a piece of cake.

00:12:38.660 --> 00:12:39.620
Yeah, it will!

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:41.330
It wasn't supposed to be funny!

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:45.950
Sorry. I'm counting on you, leader!

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.370
Guess I gotta do it.

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:05.200
Oh, Tenma. M-Morning.

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:06.700
Hey.

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:08.790
Mornin'!

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:12.120
Morning.

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:21.660
Zero triangles today.

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:26.160
Feels gloomy. Makes me gloomy.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:30.200
Morning, guys! Let's start with warmups.

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:38.700
Okay. Stretches, right?

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.500
--Hey!
--Huh?

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:41.910
What's up?

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:46.750
Who're you talking to?

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:48.370
All of you.

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:55.200
Well, about yesterday, you know...

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:57.370
What?

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:00.870
I mean, I, uh...

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:04.580
I was too harsh with you all yesterday!

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.450
Huh?

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:10.700
That's it!

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.000
What? Don't you have something else to say?

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:16.450
That was it. Hurry up and get stretching.

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:21.290
Why can't you just say "sorry" straight out?

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:25.000
That was probably his limit.

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:28.450
--Tenten, your ears are turning red!
--Wh--No they're not!
--This triangle's for you.

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:34.580
What'll happen if I can't find Oasis?

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:38.950
I've stalled things so far,
but my hands are tied now.

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:42.250
I must join the king's harem.

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:45.120
Suppress your emotions more there.

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:46.700
Yeah, whatever.

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:48.700
But your gestures were good.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:50.500
Wh--?!

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:51.660
What is it?

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:53.540
Tenten just praised him!

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:57.000
It's true, though. You were really good
at expressing your emotion.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:00.450
It's gross when you say something positive.
I have goosebumps!

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:02.120
What'd you say?!

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:05.450
Yuki, don't hide your happiness.

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:07.700
I'm not happy about it!

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:10.910
Yuki's not being honest.

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:17.660
Oh, grow up, Ali Baba.
There is no legendary paradise.

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:23.200
You're not going to get rich quick.
Try some honest work for a change.

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:25.450
It's more effective if you put a pause there.

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:27.080
O-Oh, sorry.

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:30.790
You said that nicely, though.

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:33.540
R-Right. Thanks!

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:37.200
Don't forget to put intonation in your voice.

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:40.580
And body language will
help you express more emotion.

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:43.000
Okay, I'll try it out.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:46.200
Everyone, lunch is ready!

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:47.120
Huh?!

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:50.200
I've never tried the manager's cooking.

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:52.250
Please let it not be curry.

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:53.540
What is it?

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:54.620
Onigiri!

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:56.870
Thought you'd say that, Sumi!

00:15:57.950 --> 00:15:59.620
I can't believe it.

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:01.500
Curry udon.

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:05.200
I used yesterday's leftover curry,
so I can assure you it's delicious.

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:08.040
W-Well, food is food.

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:10.950
No onigiri. The misery.

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:13.910
Sumi, here's a triangle potato!

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:17.500
It is! Tri-tri-triangle!

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:20.290
Hey.

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:21.160
Hm?

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:24.660
We're not having curry-flavored food
the whole time, are we?

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:26.950
That's for you to find out!

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:30.290
It's completely hopeless.

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:35.080
By the way, this morning's
rehearsal was much better, huh?

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:39.660
That smug look on your face
is seriously annoying.

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:43.330
I don't know what you told our hack of a leader.

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:50.160
I hate to admit it,
but his direction is accurate.

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:52.000
About acting, at least.

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.250
Huh?

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:55.000
Never mind.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:00.410
Man, I'm beat today, too.

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:01.620
Right here...

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:03.660
Good work, everyone!

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:06.290
We have an activity for you today.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:08.160
An activity?

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:09.080
"Fireworks"
An activity?

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:11.450
"Fireworks"
Summer means fireworks!

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:14.080
Making memories during
this camp is also important!

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:15.700
Yeah, sounds good.

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:16.660
"Black Snake"
Yeah, sounds good.

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:19.200
"Black Snake"
These are fireworks?

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.410
Oof.

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:26.160
Yay! Bottle rocket fireworks!

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:27.370
What the heck are those?

00:17:27.370 --> 00:17:30.370
Tenma, you've never done
bottle rocket fireworks?

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:33.750
I did sparklers for a drama shoot before.

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:37.410
Man, I got a flash of you
living the life for a sec there.

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:40.660
With an actress who's my age,
and we both wore yukata--

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.620
I don't need details.

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:48.750
Wow, it's like a scene from
a <i>shojo </i>manga. I wish I could be you!

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:54.450
Really? The sparklers were sorta dinky
and weren't that interesting.

00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:59.910
Tenten, bottle rockets explode and go <i>boom</i>.

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:00.870
What?!

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:06.120
Yeah. Then a firecracker flies out
and explodes on your head.

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:08.200
That's so dangerous!

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:11.330
Firecracker alert! Firecracker alert!

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:14.040
--Tenten!
--C-Come on, guys.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:16.200
Alrighty, light 'em up!

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:17.750
W-Wait!

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:19.620
--Three... two... one!

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:21.330
--I gotta put my helmet on!
--Three... two... one!

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:22.500
Go!

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:24.450
--Tenma--
--Watch out!

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.370
Huh?

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:39.580
Sorry. I was joking about them exploding.

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:42.040
You believed it!

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:43.410
Wh--!

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:45.000
You guys...

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.790
I said sorry!

00:18:52.910 --> 00:18:56.660
So fun! Let's do more!

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:01.870
Miyoshi.

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:07.250
Let me apologize about what I said yesterday.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:09.580
Sorry.

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:15.080
<i>Finally</i>. Figures for Tenma, our Mr. Arrogant.

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:21.290
Tenten, it's no biggie!
I pranked you, so let's call it even!

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:24.290
Hey, what are you talking about?

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:27.750
All right, to celebrate us making up...

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:34.080
<i>Tamaya!</i>

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:37.370
Jeez, they're just normal fireworks.

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:39.040
Well, duh.

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:42.160
C'mon, we're goin' nonstop!

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:53.410
A pretty triangle!

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:57.200
Sumi, pure genius!
Mind if I post this on Instablam?

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:04.500
It feels like a school trip.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:08.450
Yeah, I guess. I've never gone on one, though.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.040
What, for real?

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:15.080
Showbiz kept me busy,
so I skipped all school events.

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:17.950
Oh? That's Mr. Celeb for you.

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:19.580
It makes me a little sad.

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:25.660
I've never gone on one, either.
Nobody'd pay for my trip expenses.

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:29.410
Misumi, you've been living
at the dorm for a while.

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:31.000
Do you ever go home?

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:33.500
Nope, never.

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:39.290
Let's make a ton of memories now to make up
for what Tenten and Sumi missed out on!

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:40.290
Hang on!

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:44.790
We're buds! It'll be just like a school trip!

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:48.950
Kaz and Tenma! My buds!

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:50.790
I-I'm not sure...

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:55.080
We're just in the same theater troupe.
I dunno if I'd call us friends...

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:58.160
Ta-dah! Let's set some off
as proof of our friendship!

00:20:58.160 --> 00:21:00.200
Oh, a ground spinner.

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:01.700
What's that do?

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:07.540
It sends sparks flying at your feet,
bombarding without restraint.

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:09.660
You're just exaggerating again.

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:13.540
I'll light ten up for the special event!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:15.040
Shoot! Take cover!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.120
--Three... two... one!

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:18.450
--I'm not falling for that again.
--Three... two... one!

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:20.370
Go!

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:29.450
We warned you.

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:34.250
You trying to kill me?! What the hell?

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:37.410
That was sick!

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:38.790
Pretty!

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:39.750
Can't help you!

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:42.450
Look, Tenten, it's over there now!
